libconfig, bundled for the Android port.

Copied verbatim from AOSP's external/libconfig (lib/), which is upstream
libconfig at https://github.com/hyperrealm/libconfig, LGPL-2.1.

Why it is here rather than linked: AOSP declares libconfig as
cc_library_host_static -- host only, and with visibility restricted to
//external/wmediumd -- so there is no device variant to link against. libconfig
is not optional for shairport-sync: 24 of its functions are used across 202
call sites in shairport.c and common.c, unguarded, so it cannot be configured
out either.

Bundling it inside this fork keeps the change in the one repository that
already exists to carry the Android port, instead of forking an AOSP project or
duplicating the source into the product tree. The sources are unmodified; the
build is in ../../Android.bp.
